	(text "4x4 channel RGB/W LED driver\n- Input voltage range: 12 V to 14.5 V\n- Output max rating: 3 A, 36 W\n- LED PWM frequency: 1000 Hz\n- Fixture max power: 0.5 A spots (6 W), 3 A strips (36 W)\n- Fixture typical usage: 25% of maximum"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
