	)
	(text "Bulk capacitor sizing:\n\nSwitching maximum 3 A at minimum 400 Hz PWM\nso Qbulk = 3 A * (1 / 400 s) = 0.0075 C\nand Cbulk = Qbulk / 12 V = 625 uF"
